hadiths[74]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1754","[AI-translation] ´ Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aik aadmi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur us ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! sab logon mein kis ka haq mujh par sulook karnay ke liye zyada hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke teri maan wo bola ke phir kaun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir teri maan wo bola ke phir kaun Aap ne farmaya ke phir teri maan wo bola ke phir kaun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir tera baap (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne maan ko muqaddam kiya kis liye ke maan bacha ke saath bohat mehnat karti hai hamal no maheena phir jinna phir doodh pilana phir paalna beemari dukh mein khabar lena)"
"1755","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : god mein kisi bachay ne baat nahi ki siwae teen bachon ke aik Isa alaihissalam doosray Juraij ka saathi aur Juraij naami aik shakhs aabid tha us ne aik ibadat khana banaya aur usi mein rehta tha wo namaz padh raha tha ke us ki maan aayi aur usay bulaya ke Ae Juraij ! to wo (dil mein) kehnay laga ke ya Allah meri maan pukaarti hai aur mein namaz mein hun (mein namaz padhay jaun ya apni maan ko jawab dun) aakhir wo namaz hi mein raha to us ki maan wapas chali gayi phir jab doosra din hua to wo phir aayi aur pukara ke Ae Juraij ! wo bola ke Ae Allah ! meri maan pukaarti hai aur mein namaz mein hun aakhir wo namaz mein hi raha phir us ki maan teesray din aayi aur bulaya lekin Juraij namaz hi mein raha to us ki maan ne kaha ke ya Allah ! us ko us waqt tak na maarna jab tak ye faahisha auraton ka munh na dekh le (yani un se us ka saabiqa na paray) phir Bani Israil ne Juraij ka aur us ki ibadat ka charcha shuru kiya aur Bani Israil mein aik badkaar aurat thi jis ki khoobsurati se misaal detay thay wo boli agar tum kaho to mein Juraij ko aazmaish mein daalun phir wo aurat Juraij ke saamnay gayi lekin Juraij ne us ki taraf khayal bhi na kiya aakhir wo aik charwahay ke paas gayi jo us ke ibadat khaanay mein aa kar panah liya karta tha aur us ko apne se sohbat karnay ki ijazat di to us ne sohbat ki jis se wo hamila ho gayi jab bacha jana to boli ke bacha Juraij ka hai log ye sun kar us ke paas aaye us ko neechay utara us ke ibadat khana ko giraya aur usay maarnay lagay wo bola ke tumhein kiya hua unhon ne kaha ke to ne us badkaar aurat se zina kiya hai aur us ne tujh se aik bachay ko janam diya hai Juraij ne kaha ke wo bacha kahan hai log us ko laaye to Juraij ne kaha ke zara mujhe chhoro mein namaz padh lun phir namaz padhi aur us bacha ke paas aa kar us ke pait ko aik thoonsa diya aur bola ke Ae bachay tera baap kaun hai wo bola ke falan charwaha hai ye sun kar log Juraij ki taraf dauray aur us ko choomnay chaatnay lagay aur kehnay lagay ke ham tera ibadat khana sonay aur chaandi se binaye detay hain wo bola ke nahi jaisa tha waisa hi mitti se phir bana do to logon ne bana diya (teesra) Bani Israil mein aik bacha tha jo apni maan ka doodh pi raha tha ke itnay mein aik bohat umda janwar par khush waza khoobsurat sawaar guzra to us ki maan us ko dekh kar kehnay lagi ke ya Allah ! mere betay ko us sawaar ki tarah karna ye suntay hi us bachay ne maan ki chhaati chhor di aur sawaar ki taraf munh kar ke usay dekha aur kehnay laga ke ya Allah ! mujhe us ki tarah na karna itni baat kar ke phir chhaati mein jhuka aur doodh peenay laga Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke goya mein (us waqt) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekh raha hun ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni ungli ko choos kar dukhaya ke wo larka us tarah chhaati choosnay laga phir aik londi idhar se guzari jisay log maartay jatay thay aur kehtay thay ke to ne zina kiya aur chori ki hai wo kehti thi ke mujhe Allah Taala hi kaafi hai aur wohi mera wakeel hai to us ki maan ne kaha ke ya Allah ! mere betay ko us ki tarah na karna ye sun kar bachay ne phir doodh pina chhor diya aur us aurat ki taraf dekh kar kaha ke ya Allah mujhe usi londi ki tarah karna us waqt maan aur betay mein guftagu hui to maan ne kaha ke au sar munday ! jab aik shakhs achi soorat ka nikla aur mein ne kaha ke ya Allah ! mere betay ko aisa karna to to ne kaha ke ya Allah mujhe aisa na karna aur londi jisay log maartay jatay hain aur kehtay hain ke to ne zina kiya aur chori ki hai to mein ne kaha ke ya Allah ! mere betay ko us ki tarah ka na karna to to kehta hai ke ya Allah mujhe us ki tarah karna (ye kiya baat hai) bacha bola wo sawaar aik zaalim shakhs tha mein ne dua ki ke ya Allah mujhe us ki tarah na karna aur us londi par log tohmat lagatay hain aur kehtay hain ke to ne zina kiya aur chori ki hai halanke us ne na zina kiya hai aur na chori ki hai to mein ne kaha ke ya Allah mujhe us ki misl karna"
"1756","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aik shakhs Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur arz kiya ke mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se hijrat aur jihad par bai'at karta hun aur Allah se us ka sawab chahta hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poocha ke tere maan baap mein se koi zinda hai wo bola ke donon zinda hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poocha ke to Allah Taala se sawab chahta hai wo bola ke haan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to apne walidain ke paas laut ja aur un se naik sulook kar"
"1757","[AI-translation] ´Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak Allah Azza wa Jal ne tum par maon ki nafarmani larkion ka zinda gaarh dena (jaisay kuffaar kiya kartay thay) aur na dena (us ko jis ka dena hai maal hotay hue) aur maangna (us cheez ka jis ke maangnay ka haq nahi) ko tum par haraam kar diya hai aur teen baaton ko bura janta hai (go itna gunah nahi jitna pehli teen baaton mein hai) befaida bolna aur bohat zyada sawal karna aur maal ko barbaad karna"
"1758","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : khaak aalood ho us ki naak phir khaak aalood ho us ki naak phir khaak aalood ho us ki naak kaha gaya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kis ki farmaya ke jo apne maan baap donon ko ya un mein se aik ko boorha paye phir (un ki khidmat guzaari kar ke) jannat mein na jaye"
"1759","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` jab wo Makka ko jatay to apne saath aik gadha tafreeh ke liye rakhtay aur jab oont ki sawaari se thak jatay to us par sawaar ho jatay aur aik amama rakhtay jo sar par baandhtay thay aik din wo gadhay par ja rahay thay ke itnay mein aik airaabi nikla Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke kiya to falan bin falan nahi hai wo bola ke haan Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne us ko gadha de diya aur kaha ke us par charh ja aur amama bhi de diya aur kaha ke apne sar par baandh le Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ke baaz saathi bolay ke tum ne apni tafreeh ka gadha de diya aur amama bhi de diya jo apne sar par baandhtay thay Allah Taala tumhein bakhshay unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke bari neki ye hai ke aadmi apne baap ke faut ho janay ke baad us ke doston se (acha) sulook karay aur us dehati ka baap Umar raziyallahu anhu ka dost tha"
"1760","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mere paas aik aurat aayi us ki do betiaan us ke saath thin us ne mujh se sawal kiya to mere paas aik khajoor ke siwa kuch na tha to wohi mein ne us ko de us ne wo khajoor le kar do tukray kiye aur aik aik tukra donon betion ko diya aur khud kuch na khaya phir uthi aur chali gayi us ke baad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye to mein ne us aurat ka haal Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan kiya to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo shakhs betion mein mubtala ho (yani un ko paalay aur unhein deen ki taleem karay aur naik shakhs se nikah kar de) to wo qayamat ke din jahannam se us ki aar bin jayein gi"
"1761","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs do larkion ki parwarish un ke baaligh honay tak karay to qayamat ke din mein aur wo us tarah se aayein ge aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni ungliyon ko milaya (yani qayamat ke din mera aur us ka saath ho ga Musalman ko chahiye ke agar khud us ki larkiaan hun to khair warna do yateem larkion ko paalay aur jawan honay par un ka nikah kar de taake Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka saath us ko naseeb ho)"
"1762","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jis shakhs ko ye pasand ho ke us ki rozi barhe aur us ki umardaraaz ho to apne naatay ko milaye (yani rishta daaron se acha sulook karay)"
"1763","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik aadmi ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mere kuch rishta daar hain mein un se ta'alluq jorta hun aur wo mujh se qat' ta'alluq kartay hain ehsaan karta hun aur wo burayi kartay hain mein burdbaari karta hun aur wo jahaalat kartay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar haqeeqat mein to aisa hi karta hai to un ke munh par Jalti raakh daalta hai aur hamesha Allah ki taraf se tere saath aik farishta rahay ga jo tumhein us waqt tak un par ghalib rakhay ga jab tak to us haalat par rahay ga"
"1764","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak Allah Azza wa Jal ne khalaq ko paida kiya phir jab un ke bananay se faraaghat paayi to naata khara hua aur bola ke ye us ka muqaam hai (yani bazabaan haal ya koi farishta us ki taraf se bola aur ye taaweel hai aur zaahiri maani theek hai ke khud naata bola aur us aalim mein naatay ki zubaan honay se koi maane nahi hai) jo naata tornay se panah chahay to Allah Taala ne farmaya ke haan to us baat se khush nahi hai ke mein us ko milaon jo tujhe milaye aur us se kaaton jo tujhe kaate naata bola ke mein us se raazi hun to Allah Taala ne farmaya ke pas tujhe ye darja hasil hua phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar tumhara ji chahay to us aayat ko padh lo Allah Taala munafiqon se farmata hai ke ” agar tumhein hukumat hasil ho jaye to tum zameen mein fasaad phailao aur naaton ko toro ye wo log hain jin par Allah Taala ne lanat ki un ko (haq baat ke sun-nay se) behra kar diya aur un ki aankhon ko andha kar diya kiya wo Quran mein ghaur nahi kartay kiya (un ke) dilon par taalay hain “ (Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) : 22..24)"
"1765","[AI-translation] ´Jubair bin Mut'im raziyallahu anhu Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : rishta daari ko tornay wala shakhs jannat mein nahi jaye ga bin Abu Umar ne kaha ke Sufyan ne kaha ke yani jo shakhs rishtay naatay ko tore (wo jannat mein daakhil na ho ga)"
"1766","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : yateem ki khabargiri karnay wala khwah us ka azeez ho ya ghair ho jannat mein mein aur wo us tarah se saath hun ge jaisay ye do ungliyan aur Imam Maalik rahimahullah Allah alaihi ne kalima ki ungli aur darmiyani ungli se ishara kiya"
"1767","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs bewaon ke liye kamaye aur mehnat karay ya miskeen ke liye us ke liye aisa darja hai jaisay Allah Taala ki raah mein jihad karnay walay ka aur mein samajhta hun ke ye bhi farmaya ke jaisay us ka (darja hai) jo namaz ke liye khara rahay aur na thake aur jaisay us rozah daar ka jo rozah naagha na karay"
"1768","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak Allah Azza wa Jal qayamat ke din farmaye ga ke kahan hain wo log jo meri buzrugi aur itaat ke liye aik doosray se mohabbat kartay thay aaj ke din mein un ko apne saya mein rakhun ga aur aaj ke din mere saya ke siwa koi saya nahi hai"
"1769","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : aik shakhs apne bhai ki mulaqat ko aik doosray gaon mein gaya to Allah Taala ne us ki raah mein aik farishta khara kar diya jab wo wahan pahuncha to us farishtay ne poocha ke to kahan jata hai wo bola ke us gaon mein mera aik bhai hai mein us ko dekhnay ja raha hun farishtay ne kaha ke us ka tere upar koi ehsaan hai jis ko sambhaalnay ke liye to us ke paas jaata hai wo bola ke nahi us ka koi ehsaan mujh par nahi hai mein sirf Allah ke liye us ko dekhna chahta hun to farishta bola ke pas mein Allah Taala ka ailchi hun aur Allah tujhe chahta hai jaisay to us (Allah) ki raah mein apne bhai ko chahta hai"
"1770","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aik aadmi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! qayamat kab aaye gi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to ne qayamat ke liye kiya tayyari ki hai wo bola ke Allah Taala aur us ke Rasoolullah ki mohabbat Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to usi ke saath ho ga jis se to mohabbat rakhay ga Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ham Islam lanay ke baad kisi cheez se itna khush nahi hue jitna us hadees ke sun-nay se khush hue Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein to Allah se aur us ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aur Abu Bakr aur Umar raziyallahu anhuma se mohabbat rakhta hun aur mujhe umeed hai ke mein qayamat ke din un ke saath hun ga go mein ne un jaisay aamaal nahi kiye"
"1771","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak Allah Taala jab kisi banday se mohabbat karta hai to Jibrail alaihissalam ko bila kar farmata hai ke mein falan banday se mohabbat karta hun pas to bhi us se mohabbat kar phir Jibrail alaihissalam us se mohabbat kartay hain aur aasmaan mein munaadi kartay hain ke Allah Taala falan se mohabbat karta hai pas tum bhi us se mohabbat karo phir aasmaan walay farishtay us se mohabbat kartay hain us ke baad zameen walon ke dilon mein wo maqbool kar diya jata hai aur jab Allah Taala kisi aadmi se naraaz hota hai to Jibrail alaihissalam ko bila kar farmata hai ke mein falan se bughz rakhta hun pas tum bhi us se bughz rakho phir wo bhi us se bughz rakhtay hain phir aasmaan walon mein munaadi kar detay hain ke Allah Taala falan shakhs se bughz rakhta hai tum bhi us se bughz rakho wo bhi us se bughz rakhtay hain us ke baad zameen walon mein us ki dushmani jam jati hai (yani zameen mein bhi Allah ke jo naik banday ya farishtay hain wo us ke dushman rehtay hain)"
"1772","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) marfooan riwayat kartay hain ke` log sonay chaandi ki ma'dani kaanon ki tarah hain jo jahiliyat mein achay hotay hain wo Islam qabool karnay ke baad bhi achay hotay hain jab ke wo deen ki samajh hasil kar lein aur roohein jhand ke jhand hain phir jinhon ne un mein se aik doosray ki pehchan ki thi wo duniya mein bhi dost hoti hain aur jo wahan alag thin yahan bhi alag rehti hain"
"1773","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : momin (doosray) momin ke liye aisa hai jaisay imaarat mein aik eent doosri eent ko thaamay rehti hai (usi tarah aik momin ko lazim hai ke doosray momin ka madadgaar rahay)"
"1774","[AI-translation] ´Numan bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mominon ki misaal un ki Dausti aur ittihaad aur shafqat ke lihaaz se aik jism ki tarah hai (yani sab momin mil kar aik qaalib ki tarah hain) jism mein se jab koi uzw dard karta hai to saara jism us (takleef) mein shareek ho jata hai neend nahi aati aur bukhar aa jata hai (usi tarah aik momin par aafat aaye khusoosan wo aafat jo kafiron ki taraf se pahunche to sab mominon ko be chain hona chahiye aur us ka ilaaj karna chahiye)"
"1775","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : hasad mat karo boli barhanay ke liye qeemat mat lagao aik doosray se dushmani mat karo tum mein se koi doosray ki bai par bai na karay aur Allah ke banday bhai bhai ho jao Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai pas na us par zulm karay na us ko zaleel karay aur na us ko haqeer janay taqwa aur parhezgaari yahan hai aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne seenay ki taraf teen baar ishara kiya (yani zaahir mein umda aamaal karnay se aadmi muttaqi nahi hota jab tak us ka seena saaf na ho) aur aadmi ko ye burayi kaafi hai ke wo apne Musalman bhai ko haqeer samjhay Musalman ki sab cheezein doosray Musalman par haraam hain us ka khoon maal izzat o aabru"
"1776","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak Allah Taala tumhari sooraton aur tumharay maalon ko nahi dekhta lekin tumharay dilon aur tumharay aamaal ko dekhta hai"
"1777","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab Allah Taala kisi banday par duniya mein parda daal deta hai to aakhirat mein bhi parda daalay ga Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo koi shakhs duniya mein kisi banday ka aib chhupaye ga Allah Taala (qayamat ke din) us ka aib chhupaye ga"
"1778","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas jab koi shakhs zaroorat le kar aata to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne saathiyon se farmatay ke tum sifarish karo tumhein sawab ho ga aur Allah Taala to apne paighambar ki zubaan par wohi faisla karay ga jo chahta hai"
"1779","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : naik saathi aur buray saathi ki misaal aisi hai jaisay mushk baichnay walay aur bhatti dhonknay walay ki mushk wala ya to tujhe yunhi tohfa ke taur par soonghnay ko de ga ya to us se khareed le ga ya to us se achi khushbu paye ga aur bhatti phoonknay wala ya to tere kapray jalaaway ga ya tujhe buri boo soonghni paray gi (yani achay aur buray saathi ke asraat aadmi par murattab hotay hain)"
"1780","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Jibrail alaihissalam hamesha mujhe hamsaye ke saath naik sulook karnay ki nasihat kartay rahay yahan tak ke mein samjha ke wo hamsaye ko waris bana dein ge"
"1781","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mere dost sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe wasiyat ki ke jab to gosht pakaye to shorba zyada rakh aur apne hamsaya ke ghar walon ko dekh aur unhein us mein se de"
"1782","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mujh se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ehsaan aur neki ko mat kam samjho (yani har chotay baray ehsaan mein sawab hota hai) aur ye bhi aik ehsaan hai ke to apne bhai se kushaada peshani ke saath milay"
"1783","[AI-translation] ´Jarir raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jo shakhs narmi se mehroom hai wo bhalayi se mehroom hai"
"1784","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) Nabi usay riwayat karti hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : narmi kisi cheez mein nahi aati magar us ko muzayyan kar deti hai aur kisi cheez se door nahi ki jati magar us ko aib daar kar deti hai"
"1785","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Ae Aisha ! Allah narmi (aur khush akhlaaqi) ko pasand karta hai aur khud bhi narm hai aur narmi par wo deta hai jo sakhti par nahi deta aur na kisi aur cheez par"
"1786","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri aur Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : izzat Allah Taala ki (tehband ki) chaadar hai aur barayi us ki (orhnay ki) chaadar hai (yani ye donon us ki sifatein hain) phir Allah Azza wa Jal farmata hai ke jo koi ye mujh se chheennay ki koshish karay ga mein us ko azaab dun ga"
"1787","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Taala qayamat ke din teen aadmiyon se na to baat karay ga na un ko paak karay ga na un ki taraf (rehmat ki nazar se) dekhay ga aur un ko dukh denay wala azaab hai aik to boorha zaani doosra jhoota baadshah aur teesra mohtaaj maghroor"
"1788","[AI-translation] ´Jundub raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bayan farmaya : aik shakhs bola ke Allah ki qasam Allah Taala falan shakhs ko nahi bakhshay ga aur Allah Taala ne farmaya ke wo kaun hai jo qasam khata hai ke mein falan ko na bakhshon ga mein ne us ko bakhsh diya aur us ke (jis ne qasam khayi thi) saaray aamaal laghw (bekaar) kar diye"
"1789","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` aik aadmi ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se andar aanay ki ijazat maangi to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko ijazat do ye apne kunbay mein aik bura shakhs hai jab wo andar aaya to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se narmi se baatein kein Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap ne to us ko aisa farmaya tha phir us se narmi se baatein kein to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Aisha ! bura shakhs Allah Taala ke qareeb qayamat mein wo ho ga jis ko log us ki badgumaani ki wajah se chhor dein"
"1790","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : sadqa denay se koi maal nahi ghatta aur jo banda maaf kar deta hai Allah Taala us ki izzat barhata hai aur jo banda Allah Taala ke liye aajizi karta hai Allah Taala us ka darja buland kar deta hai"
"1791","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke be aulad tum kis ko samajhtay ho logon ne arz kiya ke us ko jis ke aulad nahi hoti (yani jiti nahi) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo be aulad nahi hai (us ki aulad to aakhirat mein us ki madad karnay ko maujood hai) be aulad haqeeqat mein wo shakhs hai jis ne apni aulad mein se apne aagay kuch na bheja (yani jis ke roobaroo us ka koi larka ya larki na maray) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke acha tum apne darmiyan pehlwaan kis ko shumaar kartay ho ham ne kaha ke pehlwaan wo hai jis ko mard pachhaar na sakein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke nahi pehlwaan to wo hai jo ghussa ke waqt apne Aap ko sambhaal le (yani zubaan se maslihat ke khilaf koi baat na kahay aur kisi par haath bhi na uthaye)"
"1792","[AI-translation] ´Sulaiman bin Surad raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` do aadmiyon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay gaali gilaunch ki un mein se aik aadmi ghussay mein aa gaya aur us ka chehra surkh ho gaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe aik kalima maloom hai ke agar ye shakhs us ko kahay to us ka ghussa jata rahay wo kalima ye hai ((A'uzu billahi minash shaitaanir rajeem)) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se sun-nay walon mein se aik shakhs ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ye sun kar ja kar us shakhs se bayan kiya (jo ghussa hua tha) to wo bola ke kiya to mujhe majnoon samajhta hai"
"1793","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab Allah Taala ne Adam alaihissalam ka patla jannat mein banaya to jitni muddat chaha usay para rehnay diya shaitaan ne us ke gird ghoomna aur us ki taraf dekhna shuru kiya phir jab us ko khaali pait dekha to pehchan liya ke ye us tarah paida kiya gaya hai jo tham na sakay ga (yani shahwat aur ghussay aur ghazab mein apne Aap ko sambhaal na sakay ga ya waswason se apne Aap ko bacha na sakay ga)"
"1794","[AI-translation] ´Nawwaas bin Sam'aan raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas Madina mein aik saal tak raha (us tarah jaisay koi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki mulaqat ke liye doosray mulk se aata hai aur apne mulk mein phir laut janay ka irada rakhta hai) aur mein ne us wajah se hijrat na ki (yani apne mulk mein janay ka irada mauqoof na kiya) ke jab koi ham mein se hijrat kar leta tha to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kuch na poochta tha (barkhilaaf musafiron ke ke un ko poochnay ki ijazat thi) mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bhalayi aur burayi ke baaray mein poocha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke bhalayi aur neki Hasan khalaq hai aur gunah wo hai jo dil mein khatkay aur logon ko us ki khabar hona tujhe bura lagay"
"1795","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : aik shakhs ne raah mein (kaanton ki) shaakh dekhi to kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! mein us ko Musalmanon ke aanay janay ki raah se hata dun ga taake un ko takleef na ho pas Allah Taala ne us ko jannat mein daakhil kar diya"
"1796","[AI-translation] ´Abu Barza raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne kaha ke ya Nabi Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! mujhe koi aisi baat batlaiye jis se mein faida uthaon to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Musalmanon ki raah se takleef denay wali cheez ko hata de"
"1797","[AI-translation] ´Aswad kehtay hain ke` Quraish ke chand naujawan Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaye jabke wo Mina mein thin aur wo log hans rahay thay Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne poocha ke tum kyun hanstay ho unhon ne kaha ke falan shakhs khema ki tanaab par gira aur us ki gardan ya aankh jatay jatay bachi Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke mat hanso us liye ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar Musalman ko aik kaanta lagay ya us se zyada koi dukh pahunche to us ke liye aik darja barhe ga aur aik gunah us ka mit jaye ga"
"1798","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) aur Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke momin ko jab koi takleef ya eeza ya beemari ya ranj ho yahan tak ke fikr jo us ko hoti hai us se bhi to us ke gunah mit jatay hain"
"1799","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` jab ye aayat naazil ke ” jo koi burayi karay ga us ko us ka badla milay ga “ to Musalmanon par bohat sakht guzra (ke har gunah ke badlay zaroor azaab ho ga) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke miyaana roi ikhtiyar karo aur theek rasta ko dhoondo aur Musalman ko (pesh aanay wali) har aik museebat (us ke liye) gunaahon ka kaffara hai yahan tak ke thokar aur kaanta bhi (lagay to bohat se gunaahon ka badla duniya hi mein ho jaye ga aur umeed hai ke aakhirat mein muakhaza na ho ga)"
"1800","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : aik doosray se bughz mat rakho aik doosray se hasad mat rakho aur aik doosray se dushmani mat rakho aur Allah ke bando bhaiyon ki tarah raho aur kisi Musalman ko halal nahi hai ke apne bhai se teen din se zyada tak (bughz ki wajah se) bolna chhor de"
"1801","[AI-translation] ´Abu Ayyub Ansari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kisi Musalman ko ye baat durust nahi hai ke wo apne Musalman bhai se teen raaton se zyada tak (bolna) chhor de us tarah par ke wo donon milein to aik apna munh idhar aur doosra apna munh idhar pher le aur un donon mein behtar wo ho ga jo salam mein pehal karay ga"
"1802","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat ke darwazay peer aur Jumeraat ke din khole jatay hain phir har aik banday ki maghfirat hoti hai jo Allah Taala ke saath kisi ko shareek nahi karta lekin jo shakhs jo apne bhai se keena rakhta hai us ki maghfirat nahi hoti aur hukm hota hai ke un donon ko dekhtay raho jab tak ke sulah kar lein un donon ko dekhtay raho jab tak ke sulah kar lein (jab sulah kar lein ge to un ki maghfirat ho gi)"
"1803","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum badgumaani se bacho kyunke badgumaani bara jhoot hai aur kisi ki baaton par kaan mat lagao aur jaasoosi na karo aur (duniya mein) rashk mat karo (lekin deen mein durust hai) aur hasad na karo aur bughz mat rakho aur tark mulaqat mat karo aur Allah ke bando aur (aapas mein) bhai bhai bin jao"
"1804","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke beshak shaitaan us baat se naaumeed ho gaya hai ke us ko namazi log Arab ke jazeera mein poojein ge (jaisay jahiliyat ke door mein poojtay thay) lekin shaitaan un ko bharka de ga (yani aapas mein larai karanay mein purumeed hai)"
"1805","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam raat ko un ke paas se niklay pas mujhe ghairat aayi (wo ye samajhein ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur kisi bi bi ke paas tashreef le gaye hain) phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aaye aur mera haal dekha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Aisha ! tujhe kiya hua kiya tujhe ghairat aayi mein ne kaha ke mujhe kiya hua jo meri si bi bi (kam Umar khoobsurat) ko Aap jaisay shohar par rashk na aaye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya tera shaitaan tere paas aa gaya mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kiya mere saath shaitaan hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke haan mein ne kaha ke kiya wo har insaan ke saath hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke haan phir mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap ke saath bhi hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke haan lekin mere Rab ne meri madad ki hai hatta ke wo mere taabe ho gaya hai (ab mujhe burayi ka hukm nahi deta)"
"1806","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kiya tum jantay ho ke gheebat kiya hai logon ne kaha ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah khoob jantay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke gheebat ye hai ke to apne bhai ka zikr us tarah par karay ke (agar wo saamnay ho to) us ko nagawar guzray logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! agar hamaray bhai mein wo aib maujood ho to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab hi to ye gheebat ho gi nahi to buhtaan aur iftira hai"
"1807","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` beshak Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kiya mein tumhein ye na batlaun ke buhtaan qabeeh kiya cheez hai wo chughli hai jo logon mein adaawat daalay aur Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aadmi sach bolta rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke qareeb sacha likha jata hai aur jhoot bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke qareeb jhoota likh liya jata hai"
"1808","[AI-translation] ´Hammaam bin Haris kehtay hain ke` ham Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas masjid mein baithay thay ke aik aadmi aaya aur hamaray paas aa kar baith gaya logon ne Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke ye aadmi baadshah tak baat pahunchata hai Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne us ko sunanay ki niyyat se kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke chughal khor jannat mein na jaye ga"
"1809","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum sach ko lazim kar lo kyunke sach neki ki taraf raah dikhaata hai aur neki jannat ko le jati hai aur aadmi sach bolta rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah Taala ke qareeb sacha likh liya jata hai aur jhoot se bacho kyunke jhoot burayi ki taraf raah dikhaata hai aur burayi jahannam ko le jati hai aur aadmi jhoot bolta rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah Taala ke qareeb jhoota likh liya jata hai"
"1810","[AI-translation] ´Umm Kulsoom bint Uqba bin Abu Mu'ait raziyallahu anha se riwayat hai` aur wo muhaajiraat awwal mein se thin jinhon ne Rasoolullah usay bai'at ki thi ke unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farma rahay thay ke jhoota wo nahi jo logon mein sulah karaye aur behtar baat behtari ki niyyat se kahay bin Shihab ne kaha ke mein ne nahi suna ke kisi jhoot mein rukhsat di gayi ho magar teen mauqaon par aik to larai mein doosray logon mein sulah karanay ke liye aur teesray shohar ko biwi se aur biwi ko shohar se (khush tab'i ke liye) aur aik riwayat mein kehti hain ke mein ne nahi suna ke kisi jhoot mein rukhsat di gayi ho magar teen mauqaon par (yani larai mein doosray logon mein sulah karanay ke liye aur teesray shohar ko biwi se aur biwi ko shohar se) (khush tab'i ke liye)"
"1811","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath aik ghazwa mein thay ke aik Muhaajir ne aik Ansaar ki sireen par maara (haath se ya talwaar se) Ansari ne aawaz di ke Ae Ansaar dauro ! aur Muhaajir ne aawaz di ke Ae Muhajireen dauro ! Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye to jahiliyat ka sa pukaarna hai logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! aik Muhaajir ne aik Ansari ki sireen par maara hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us baat ko chhoro ke ye gandi baat hai ye khabar Abdullah bin Abu (munafiq) ko pahunchi to wo bola ke Muhajireen ne aisa kiya Allah ki qasam ham Madina ko lautein ge to ham mein se izzat wala shakhs zaleel shakhs ko wahan se nikaal de ga (maazAllah us munafiq ne apne Aap ko izzat wala qarar diya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko zaleel kaha) Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mujhe us munafiq ki gardan maarnay dijiye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke janay de (Ae Umar) ! kahein log ye na kahein ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne saathiyon ko qatl kartay hain (go wo mardood usi qaabil tha lekin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne maslihat se us ko saza na di)"
"1812","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : do shakhs jab gaali gilaunch karein to donon ka gunah usi par ho ga jo ibtida karay ga jab tak ke mazloom ziyadati na kar le"
"1813","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Azza wa Jal farmata hai ke mujhe aadmi takleef deta hai kehta hai ke haaye kambakhti zamanay ki to koi tum mein se yun na kahay ke haaye kambakhti zamanay ki us liye ke zamana mein hun raat aur din mein lata hun jab mein chahun ga to raat aur din khatm kar dun ga (jab raat din ko paida karnay wala Allah Taala hai to raat aur din ko yani zamana ko gaaliaan dena darasal Allah ko gaali dena ho ga)"
"1814","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum zamanay ko bura mat kaho us liye ke Allah Taala khud zamana hai (yani zamana kuch nahi kar sakta karnay wala to Allah Taala hi hai)"
"1815","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum mein se koi apne bhai ko hathiyar se na dhamkaaye maloom nahi ke shaitaan us ke haath ko dagmagaaye (aur haath chal jaye) aur phir (apne bhai ko maarnay ke sabab) jahannam ke garhay mein chala jaye"
"1816","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik shakhs ko jo ke masjid ke qareeb teer baantta tha ye hukm diya ke jab teer le kar niklay to un ki paikaan (yani nok wali taraf) thaam liya karay"
"1817","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab koi tum mein se masjid ya bazaar mein guzray aur us ke haath mein teer hun to chahiye ke un ki nok se apne haath mein pakar le phir nok se pakar le phir nok se pakar le (teen baar taakeed ke liye farmaya) Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ham nahi maray yahan tak ke ham ne teer ko aik doosray ke munh par lagaya (yani aapas mein laray aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke irshaad ke khilaf kiya)"
"1818","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab koi tum mein se apne bhai se laray to us ke munh par na maaray"
"1819","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se laray to us ke munh se bacha rahay us liye ke Allah Taala ne aadmi ko apni soorat par banaya hai (ye nisbat tashreefan hai jaisay Kaaba Allah ki nisbat Allah ki taraf hai yani bait Allah)"
"1820","[AI-translation] ´Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik safar mein thay aur aik Ansari aurat aik oontni par sawaar thi wo tarpi to aurat ne us par lanat ki Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne suna to farmaya ke us oontni par jo kuch hai wo utaar lo aur us ko chhor do kyunke wo mal'oon hai Imran raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke goya mein us oontni ko us waqt dekh raha hun ke wo phirti thi aur logon mein se koi us ki parwa na karta tha"
"1821","[AI-translation] ´Abud Darda (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jo log lanat kartay hain wo qayamat ke din kisi ki shafaat na karein ge aur na gawah hun ge"
"1822","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kaha gaya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mushrikon par baddua kijiye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein us liye nahi bheja gaya ke logon par lanat karun balke rehmat (ka sabab) bana kar bheja gaya hun"
"1823","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab koi (apne Aap ko umda aur logon ko haqeer jaan kar) ye kahay ke log halaak hue to wo khud sab se zyada halaak honay wala hai (aur agar afsos ya ranj se deen ki kharaabi par kahay to mana nahi hai) Ishaq (bin Muhammad bin Sufyan) ne ke mein nahi janta ke hadees mein lafz ” ahlak “ hai ya lafz ” ahlak “ hai"
"1824","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : baal ki khaal utarnay walay tabah hue (yani befaida moshgaafi karnay walay had se zyada barhnay walay aur ta'assub karnay walay) teen baar yehi farmaya"
"1825","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` do shakhs Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur mein nahi jaanti ke unhon ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kiya baatein kein ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ghussa aa gaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un donon par lanat ki aur un ko bura kaha jab wo bahar niklay to mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! un donon ko kuch faida na ho ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kyun mein ne arz kiya ke us wajah se ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un par lanat ki aur un ko bura kaha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tujhe maloom nahi jo mein ne apne Rab se shart ki hai mein ne arz kiya hai ke Ae mere Maalik ! mein Bishr hun to jis Musalman par mein lanat karun ya us ko bura kahun to us ko paak kar aur sawab de"
"1826","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha ke paas aik yateem larki thi jis ko Umm Anas kehtay thay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us larki ko dekha to farmaya ke ! wo larki to bari ho gayi Allah karay teri Umar bari na ho wo larki ye sun kar Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha ke paas roti hui gayi to Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke beti tujhe kiya hua wo boli ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh par baddua ki ke meri Umar bari na ho ab mein kabhi bari na hun gi ya ye farmaya ke teri hamjoli bari na ho ye sun kar Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha jaldi se apni orhni orhti hui niklein aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se milein to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya hai Umm Sulaim wo bolein ke Ae Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! Aap ne meri yateem larki ko baddua di Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poocha ke kiya baddua wo bolein ke wo kehti hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ki ya us ki hamjoli ki umardaraaz na ho ye sun kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam muskuraye aur farmaya ke Ae Umm Sulaim ! to nahi jaanti ke mein ne apne Rab se shart ki hai meri shart ye hai ke mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Rab ! mein aik Bishr hun aur khush hota hun jaisay aadmi khush hota hai aur ghussa hota hun jaisay aadmi ghussa hota hai pas mein apni ummat mein se jis kisi par baddua karun aisi baddua jis ke wo laiq nahi to us ke liye qayamat ke din paaki karna aur taharat aur apna qurb ataa karna aur Abu Maan ne us hadees mein teenon jagah ” yateema “ ki bajaye ” yateema “ tasgheer ke saath bayan kiya hai"
"1827","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein bachon ke saath khail raha tha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye aur mein aik darwazay ke peechay chhup gaya pas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne dast mubarak se mujhe (pyaar se) thapka aur farmaya ke ja Muawiya ko bila la mein gaya phir laut kar aaya aur mein ne kaha ke wo khana kha rahay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne phir farmaya ke ja aur Muawiya ko bila la mein phir laut kar aaya aur kaha ke wo khana kha rahay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah us ka pait na bhare bin Musanna ne kaha ke mein ne Umayya se kaha ke ” hata “ ka kiya matlab hai unhon ne farmaya ke us ka maani hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne gudi par bin Abbas raziyallahu anhuma ko maara (ye hadees bhi usi maani mein hai jaisay pichli ahadees mein guzra ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Allah Taala par shart lagayi hai ke agar kisi ke liye khilaf waqia koi baat kar dun to us ke liye rehmat ho jaye us liye ye hadees Muawiya raziyallahu anhu ke manaaqib mein hai)"
